uri "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-manufacturingProcess" alias AM-CDM-manufacturingProcess version "$Revision:$ Last modified on   $Date:$".

import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-system".
import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-part".

ManufacturingProcessStep (note "Planned process in which input material is transformed or modified.") is a type of PlannedProcessStep,
	described by processSpecification (note "Specification that governs how the manufacturing process step is performed.") with a single value of type ManufacturingStepSpecification,
	described by mfgProcessMachine (note "Machine used to transform the input material.") with a single value of type System,
	described by mfgProcessControlSoftware (note "Software applications used to control the process step.") with values of type Software,
	described by mfgProcessConsumables (note "Consumables used during the process step.") with values of type Consumables,
	described by mfgProcessMaterialInputs (note "Materials provided as inputs to the process step.") with values of type MaterialInputs,
	described by mfgProcessMaterialOutputs (note "Material stocks or parts created by the process step.") with values of type MaterialOutputs,
	described by mfgProcessSimulation (note "Simulation records associated with the process step.") with values of type ProcessSimulation.

ManufacturingStepSpecification (note "Specification that prescribes how a manufacturing process step is performed.") is a type of ProcessStepSpecification,
	described by mfgSpecGlobalProcessParameters (note "Nominal system settings that apply to all material stock involved in the manufacturing process step.") with values of type GlobalProcessParameters,
	described by mfgSpecPartSpecificProcessParameters (note "Nominal system settings that apply uniquely to an individual part to be processed.") with values of type PartSpecificProcessParameters,
	described by mfgSpecEnvironment (note "Set of environmental conditions maintained during the manufacturing process step.") with a single value of type Environment.

GlobalProcessParameters (note "Nominal system settings that apply to all material stock involved in a manufacturing process step.") is a class.
processStepSpecification of ManufacturingProcessStep only has values of type ManufacturingStepSpecification.

Consumables (note "Materials used during the execution of a process that do not substantially become part of the material output.") is a class.

MaterialInputs (note "Materials that are inputs to a process and substantially become part of the material output.") is a class.
MaterialOutputs (note "Materials produced as output by a process.") is a class.

ProcessSimulation (note "Data used and generated by computer programs that employ physics-based models.") is a class,
	described by simulationID (note "Globally unique identifier assigned to a specific simulation within the data model.") with a single value of type string,
	described by simulationModel (note "Document that describes the physical phenomena and mathematical equations used in the simulation.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by simulationSoftware (note "Software applications used to perform the simulation.") with values of type Software,
	described by simulationInputs (note "Document specifying the parameters used as inputs to the simulation.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by simulationOutputs (note "Document containing the results produced by the simulation.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by simulationModelDomain (note "Physical disciplines, such as thermal or structural analysis, represented by the simulation model.") with values of type string,
	described by simulationModelDefinition (note "Document describing how the simulation model is constructed, including its equations, inputs and outputs.") with a single value of type Document.

PowderStockInput (note "Powder stock provided as input to a process.") is a type of MaterialInputs,
	described by powderStockInput (note "Powder stocks supplied as input to the process step.") with values of type PowderStock.

PowderStockOutput (note "Powder stock produced as output by a process.") is a type of MaterialOutputs,
	described by powderStockOutput (note "Powder stocks produced as output by the process step.") with values of type PowderStock.

Blending (note "Process in which metal powders are mixed.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

mfgProcessMaterialInputs of Blending only has values of type PowderStockInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of Blending only has values of type PowderStockOutput.

MaterialStockInput (note "Material stock provided as input to a process.") is a type of MaterialInputs,
	described by materialStockInput (note "Material stocks supplied as input to the process step.") with values of type MaterialStock.

MaterialStockOutput (note "Material stock produced as output by a process.") is a type of MaterialOutputs,
	described by materialStockOutput (note "Material stocks produced as output by the process step.") with values of type MaterialStock.

MaterialHT (note "Manufacturing process step in which material stock undergoes thermal heat treatment.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

processSpecification of MaterialHT only has values of type HTProcessStepSpecification.
processData of MaterialHT only has values of type HTProcessStepData.
mfgProcessMachine of MaterialHT only has values of type HTSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of MaterialHT only has values of type MaterialStockInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of MaterialHT only has values of type MaterialStockOutput.
 
PartMaterialInput (note "Part provided as input to a process.") is a type of MaterialInputs,
	described by partInput (note "Parts supplied as input to the process step.") with values of type Part.

PartMaterialOutput (note "Part produced as output by a process.") is a type of MaterialOutputs,
	described by partOutput (note "Parts produced as output by the process step.") with values of type Part.

PartHT (note "Manufacturing process step in which a part undergoes thermal heat treatment.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

processSpecification of PartHT only has values of type HTProcessStepSpecification.
processData of PartHT only has values of type HTProcessStepData.
mfgProcessMachine of PartHT only has values of type HTSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of PartHT only has values of type PartMaterialInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of PartHT only has values of type PartMaterialOutput.

MaterialHIP (note "Manufacturing process step in which material stock undergoes hot isostatic pressing.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

processSpecification of MaterialHIP only has values of type HIPProcessStepSpecification.
processData of MaterialHIP only has values of type HIPProcessStepData.
mfgProcessMachine of MaterialHIP only has values of type HIPSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of MaterialHIP only has values of type MaterialStockInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of MaterialHIP only has values of type MaterialStockOutput.

PartHIP (note "Manufacturing process step in which a part undergoes hot isostatic pressing.") is a type of ManufacturingProcessStep.

processSpecification of PartHIP only has values of type HTProcessStepSpecification.
processData of PartHIP only has values of type HTProcessStepData.
mfgProcessMachine of PartHIP only has values of type HIPSystem.
mfgProcessMaterialInputs of PartHIP only has values of type PartMaterialInput.
mfgProcessMaterialOutputs of PartHIP only has values of type PartMaterialOutput.

